<!DOCTYPE html> <html lang="en"> <head> <meta charset="UTF-8"> <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0"> <title>Bryars A.I. 0.2 - Extended Mastercore</title> <link rel="stylesheet" href="styles.css"> </head> <body> <div id="app-container"> <header class="app-header"> <h1>Bryars A.I. <span class="badge">v0.2</span></h1> <div class="header-controls"> <button id="permissions-btn" class="btn-secondary" onclick="openPermissionsModal()">Hardware & Permissions</button> </div> </header>
<main class="main-content"> <div id="chat-view" class="view active"> <div id="chat-messages"></div> <div class="chat-input-area"> <textarea id="user-input" placeholder="Query Mastercore or corpus..."></textarea> <button id="send-btn" onclick="sendMessage()">Send</button> </div> </div> </main> </div>
<!-- Permissions and Hardware Diagnostic Modal --> <div id="permissions-modal" class="modal" style="display:none;"> <div class="modal-content"> <h2>Hardware & Data Access Requests</h2> <p>Bryars A.I. 0.2 requests the following local device permissions and interfaces for advanced Mastercore operations:</p>
<ul class="permission-list"> <li> <strong>Microphone Access:</strong> <span id="perm-mic" class="status-badge">Pending</span> <button onclick="requestPermission('mic')">Request Mic</button> </li> <li> <strong>USB OTG Access:</strong> <span id="perm-otg" class="status-badge">Pending</span> <button onclick="requestPermission('otg')">Detect OTG</button> </li> <li> <strong>USB Debugging Status:</strong> <span id="perm-debug" class="status-badge">Checking</span> <button onclick="checkUsbDebugging()">Query Port</button> </li> <li> <strong>Contacts Access:</strong> <span id="perm-contacts" class="status-badge">Pending</span> <button onclick="requestPermission('contacts')">Request Contacts</button> </li> <li> <strong>Bluetooth Control:</strong> <span id="perm-bt" class="status-badge">Pending</span> <button onclick="requestPermission('bluetooth')">Enable Bluetooth</button> </li> <li> <strong>Wi-Fi State / Network:</strong> <span id="perm-wifi" class="status-badge">Pending</span> <button onclick="requestPermission('wifi')">Query Wi-Fi</button> </li> </ul> <button class="btn-primary" onclick="closePermissionsModal()">Close</button> </div> </div>
<script src="core/bryars-content.js"></script> <script src="core/bryars-chat-store.js"></script> <script src="core/bryars-core-mode.js"></script> <script src="core/bryars-conversation-contract.js"></script> <script src="app.js"></script> <script> function openPermissionsModal() { document.getElementById('permissions-modal').style.display = 'block'; } function closePermissionsModal() { document.getElementById('permissions-modal').style.display = 'none'; } function requestPermission(type) { const badge = document.getElementById('perm-' + type); badge.innerText = 'Requested / Evaluating'; badge.style.color = '#f1c40f';
// Bridge or simulated native permission callback if (window.AndroidBridge && typeof window.AndroidBridge.requestPermission === 'function') { window.AndroidBridge.requestPermission(type); } else { setTimeout(() => { badge.innerText = 'Granted (Simulated)'; badge.style.color = '#2ecc71'; }, 600); } } function checkUsbDebugging() { const badge = document.getElementById('perm-debug'); badge.innerText = 'Active / Connected'; badge.style.color = '#3498db'; } </script> </body> </html>
